# kdiff: the same workload on two clusters, side by side
Output docs/kdiff.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "kdiff"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "staging api/api"
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Down
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
